        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_futures_price = 865.0\n    closing_futures_price = 877.0\n    annual_collateral_rate = 0.006\n    holding_period_years = 3 / 12\n\n    # Calculate the futures price return and collateral return\n    futures_return = (\n        closing_futures_price - initial_futures_price\n    ) / initial_futures_price\n    collateral_return = annual_collateral_rate * holding_period_years\n    total_return = (futures_return + collateral_return) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_return, 3)\n```",
